    PARTY `2021 c 2 s 4 a medical practitioner or nurse practitioner` DOES `2021 c 2 s 4 provide medical assistance in dying in accordance with section 241.2 as it read immediately before that day, other than paragraph 241.2(3)(g), and with subsections 241.2(3.2) to (3.5) as enacted by that Act` AT 1

